> {{humanName}} icons for the Ichava Laravel icon ecosystem.

Add a registry-version badge once this package is published; until then there is no version to
show. Requires [`ichava/core`](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/core/);
targets PHP `^8.4.1 || ^8.5` on Laravel `^13`.

## Install

```bash
composer require {{packageName}}
php artisan ichava::ichava-core.database seed --package={{packageName}}
```

The seed is not optional — until it runs the registry holds no rows for this pack and every
lookup returns nothing. See core's
[installation guide](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/core/installation).

